B.7. %e šu-um-du-um %s šar₂-re-ba [...]
#lem: šumdum[lip]N; šar[numerous]V/i; X
#tr.en: On its full lips ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.7

B.8. a sur-sur-ra %e de₃-[mu-X]
#lem: a[water]; sur[press]; X
#tr.en: Let the dripping (?) waters ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.8

B.9. ma₂-addir a-ra-zu a-ra-zu lu₂ [...]
#lem: maʾaddir[ferryboat]; arazu[supplication]; arazu[supplication]; lu[person]; X
#tr.en: The ferry boat, a prayer, a prayer, …… man ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.9

B.10. ni₂-ŋu₁₀ il₂#-la# ni₂-ŋu₁₀ [il₂-la]
#lem: ni[fear]; il[raise]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: Imbued (?) with my awesomeness! Imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.10

B.11. nam-til₃ %e u₃-mu-un-na %s ni₂-ŋu₁₀ il₂#-[la]
#lem: namtil[life]; umun[lord]N; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: The life of the lord, imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.11

B.12. nam-til₃ lugal-la ni₂-ŋu₁₀ il₂#-[la]
#lem: namtil[life]; lugal[king]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
