#etcsl: line-id=B.12

B.13. zi šag₄-ge si-a ni₂-ŋu₁₀ il₂#-[la]
#lem: zi[life]; šag[heart]; si[fill]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: Filling throat and heart, imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
