B.14. {gi}en₃-bar kuara{ki} ni₂-ŋu₁₀ [il₂-la]
#lem: enbar[reed]; Kuʾara[1]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: The marsh reeds of @wSN{Kuara}, imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.14

B.15. {gi}en₃-bar sag₉-sag₉-ga ni₂-ŋu₁₀ [il₂-la]
#lem: enbar[reed]; sag[good]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: The most beautiful marsh reeds, imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.15

B.16. iri ki-bi gi-a ni₂-ŋu₁₀ [il₂-la]
#lem: iri[city]; ki[place]; gi[turn]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: The city which is restored, imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.16

B.17. KA-KA niŋ₂ sag₉-ga ni₂-ŋu₁₀ [il₂-la]
#lem: X; niŋ[thing]; sag[good]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: The beauteous countenance, imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.17

B.18. %e me-ri %s ki-a sig₁₀-ga ni₂-ŋu₁₀ [il₂-la]
#lem: meri[foot]N; ki[place]; sig[put into]; ni[fear]; il[raise]
#tr.en: A foot placed on the earth, imbued (?) with my awesomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.18

