B.22. in-ŋa₂-e-re₇-de₃-en in-ŋa₂-[e-re₇-de₃-en]
#lem: ere[go (perfect plural stem of ŋen⟦to go⟧)]; ere[go (perfect plural stem of ŋen⟦to go⟧)]
#tr.en: We shall go! We shall go! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.22

B.23. me-en-de₃ šudu₃-de₃ in-ŋa₂-[e-re₇-de₃-en]
#lem: menden[we]; šud[prayer]; ere[go (perfect plural stem of ŋen⟦to go⟧)]
#tr.en: We shall go in supplication! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.23

B.24. šudu₃ %e u₃-mu-un#-[na-še₃] %s <in-ŋa₂-e-re₇-de₃-en>
#lem: šud[prayer]; umun[lord]N; ere[go (perfect plural stem of ŋen⟦to go⟧)]
#tr.en: We shall go for the supplication of the lord! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.24

B.25. šudu₃ lugal-la-še₃ <in-ŋa₂-e-re₇-de₃-en>
#lem: šud[prayer]; lugal[king]; ere[go (perfect plural stem of ŋen⟦to go⟧)]
#tr.en: We shall go for the supplication of the king! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.25

B.26. šudu₃ ub-ba-ke₄ ub-e mu-ni-[...]
#lem: šud[prayer]; ub[corner]; ub[corner]; X
#tr.en: Those of the supplication of the corner …… at the corner. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.26

B.27. šudu₃ da#-ke₄ da#-e mu-ni-[...]
#lem: šud[prayer]; dag[side]; dag[side]; X
#tr.en: Those of the supplication of the side …… at the side. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.27

B.28. ama {d}inana an-na-ke₄ [hi]-li-a [...]
#lem: ama[mother]; Inanak[1]DN; an[sky]; hili[attractiveness]; X
#tr.en: Mother @wDN{Inana} of heaven …… with beauty. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.28

B.29. %e mu-gi₁₇-ib %s niŋin₃-ŋar-X# [hi]-li-a mu-ni-[...]
#lem: mugib[priestess]N; niŋar[cella]; hili[attractiveness]; X
#tr.en: The Mistress …… with beauty in the shrine. 
